{"id": "sql-001", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu tháng này bao nhiêu?", "request": {}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["(SUM(t0.amount)) AS \"value\"", "FROM \"orders\" AS t0", "t0.status = 'paid'"], "sql_not_contains": ["net_amount", "GROUP BY"]}, "tag": "resolution"}
{"id": "sql-002", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu thuần tháng này bao nhiêu?", "request": {}, "expect": {"metric": "net_revenue", "sql_contains": ["(SUM(t0.net_amount)) AS \"value\"", "FROM \"orders\" AS t0", "t0.status = 'paid'"], "sql_not_contains": ["SUM(t0.amount)"]}, "tag": "longest-synonym-wins", "note": "The whole point of the registry: 'doanh thu thuần' must not resolve to the gross metric."}
{"id": "sql-003", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu theo tháng", "request": {"grain": "month"}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["TO_CHAR(t0.created_at, 'YYYY-MM') AS \"period\"", "(SUM(t0.amount)) AS \"value\"", "GROUP BY TO_CHAR(t0.created_at, 'YYYY-MM')", "ORDER BY TO_CHAR(t0.created_at, 'YYYY-MM')"], "sql_not_contains": []}, "tag": "grain"}
{"id": "sql-004", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu theo quý", "request": {"grain": "quarter"}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["THEN '-Q3'", "AS \"period\""], "sql_not_contains": ["'YYYY-MM') AS \"period\""]}, "tag": "grain"}
{"id": "sql-005", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu theo miền", "request": {"dimensions": ["region"]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["t0.region AS \"region\"", "(SUM(t0.amount)) AS \"value\"", "GROUP BY t0.region"], "sql_not_contains": ["\"period\""]}, "tag": "dimension"}
{"id": "sql-006", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu theo miền theo tháng", "request": {"dimensions": ["region"], "grain": "month"}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["TO_CHAR(t0.created_at, 'YYYY-MM') AS \"period\"", "t0.region AS \"region\"", "GROUP BY t0.region, TO_CHAR(t0.created_at, 'YYYY-MM')"], "sql_not_contains": []}, "tag": "dimension+grain"}
{"id": "sql-007", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu theo kênh bán", "request": {"dimensions": ["channel"]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["t0.sales_channel AS \"channel\"", "GROUP BY t0.sales_channel"], "sql_not_contains": []}, "tag": "dimension-is-a-business-key", "note": "The case asks for 'channel'; the physical column is sales_channel. A model-written query would have to guess it."}
{"id": "sql-008", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu quý 1 2024", "request": {"time_range": ["2024-01-01", "2024-04-01"]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["t0.created_at >= CAST('2024-01-01' AS DATE)", "t0.created_at < CAST('2024-04-01' AS DATE)"], "sql_not_contains": ["BETWEEN", "<= CAST('2024-04-01'"]}, "tag": "time-range-half-open", "note": "Half-open on purpose: BETWEEN double-counts the boundary row."}
{"id": "sql-009", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu miền bắc quý 1 2024 theo tháng", "request": {"dimensions": ["region"], "grain": "month", "time_range": ["2024-01-01", "2024-04-01"], "filters": [{"column": "region", "op": "eq", "value": "mien_bac"}]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["t0.status = 'paid'", "t0.region = 'mien_bac'", "t0.created_at >= CAST('2024-01-01' AS DATE)", "t0.created_at < CAST('2024-04-01' AS DATE)", "TO_CHAR(t0.created_at, 'YYYY-MM') AS \"period\""], "sql_not_contains": []}, "tag": "full-request", "note": "Contract filter AND caller filter must both survive; dropping the always-on one silently changes the number."}
{"id": "sql-010", "catalog": "retail", "question": "số đơn hàng theo miền", "request": {"dimensions": ["region"]}, "expect": {"metric": "order_count", "sql_contains": ["(COUNT(t0.id)) AS \"value\"", "GROUP BY t0.region"], "sql_not_contains": ["COUNT(DISTINCT"]}, "tag": "count-vs-distinct"}
{"id": "sql-011", "catalog": "retail", "question": "số khách hàng theo miền", "request": {"dimensions": ["region"]}, "expect": {"metric": "customer_count", "sql_contains": ["(COUNT(DISTINCT t0.customer_id)) AS \"value\"", "GROUP BY t0.region"], "sql_not_contains": ["COUNT(t0.id)"]}, "tag": "count-vs-distinct", "note": "sql-010 and sql-011 differ only by this choice. Getting it wrong is a plausible-looking wrong number."}
{"id": "sql-012", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu 2024 theo năm", "request": {"grain": "year", "time_range": ["2024-01-01", "2025-01-01"]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["TO_CHAR(t0.created_at, 'YYYY') AS \"period\"", "t0.created_at >= CAST('2024-01-01' AS DATE)"], "sql_not_contains": []}, "tag": "grain"}
{"id": "sql-013", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu theo ngày", "request": {"grain": "day", "dialect": "clickhouse"}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["t0.created_at AS \"period\"", "GROUP BY t0.created_at"], "sql_not_contains": ["formatDateTime", "DATE_TRUNC"]}, "tag": "dialect", "note": "A day cut keeps the column as it is: the time dimension is a date, so there is nothing to cut."}
{"id": "sql-014", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu theo tháng", "request": {"grain": "month", "dialect": "clickhouse"}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["formatDateTime(t0.created_at, '%Y-%m') AS \"period\""], "sql_not_contains": ["TO_CHAR", "DATE_TRUNC"]}, "tag": "dialect"}
{"id": "sql-015", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu các miền bắc và trung", "request": {"filters": [{"column": "region", "op": "in", "value": ["mien_bac", "mien_trung"]}]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["t0.region IN ('mien_bac', 'mien_trung')"], "sql_not_contains": []}, "tag": "filter-op"}
{"id": "sql-016", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu không tính miền nam", "request": {"filters": [{"column": "region", "op": "not_in", "value": ["mien_nam"]}]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["NOT t0.region IN ('mien_nam')"], "sql_not_contains": []}, "tag": "filter-op"}
{"id": "sql-017", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu các đơn chưa gán miền", "request": {"filters": [{"column": "region", "op": "is_null"}]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["t0.region IS NULL"], "sql_not_contains": ["region = NULL"]}, "tag": "filter-op"}
{"id": "sql-018", "catalog": "retail", "question": "gmv cũ theo tháng", "request": {"grain": "month"}, "expect": {"metric": null, "reason": "deprecated"}, "tag": "deprecated-metric", "note": "A retired formula must not answer silently. No match is the correct outcome; the caller falls back."}
{"id": "sql-019", "catalog": "retail", "question": "thời tiết hôm nay thế nào?", "request": {}, "expect": {"metric": null, "reason": "no-metric"}, "tag": "no-false-match", "note": "Most questions are not about a registered metric. Resolving one anyway would answer a question nobody asked."}
{"id": "sql-020", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu theo phòng ban", "request": {}, "expect": {"metric": null, "reason": "the cut names no dimension: asked back"}, "tag": "unplaced-cut", "note": "'phòng ban' is not in the contract. The Understander asks which cut is meant rather than answering the total, which would answer another question (BR-80)."}
{"id": "sql-021", "catalog": "retail", "question": "top 5 miền doanh thu cao nhất", "request": {"dimensions": ["region"]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["ORDER BY \"value\" DESC NULLS LAST LIMIT 5"], "sql_not_contains": ["ORDER BY t0.region"]}, "tag": "ranking"}
{"id": "sql-022", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu", "request": {"dialect": "mysql"}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["FROM `orders` AS t0", "(SUM(t0.amount)) AS `value`", "t0.status = 'paid'"], "sql_not_contains": ["\"orders\""]}, "tag": "dialect", "note": "Every dialect a source speaks is compiled, MySQL's backticks included; a source the guard has no dialect for is refused before it gets here (sql_guard.dialect_of)."}
{"id": "sql-023", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu theo tháng", "request": {"grain": "month"}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_guard_clean": true, "sql_contains": []}, "tag": "compiled-sql-passes-the-guard", "note": "Compiled SQL is executed by the same read-only path as model-written SQL. If the compiler ever emits something the guard rejects, the semantic path breaks in production, not here."}
{"id": "sql-024", "catalog": "retail", "question": "số khách hàng miền bắc quý 1 2024", "request": {"time_range": ["2024-01-01", "2024-04-01"], "filters": [{"column": "region", "op": "eq", "value": "mien_bac"}]}, "expect": {"metric": "customer_count", "sql_contains": ["(COUNT(DISTINCT t0.customer_id)) AS \"value\"", "t0.region = 'mien_bac'", "t0.created_at >= CAST('2024-01-01' AS DATE)"], "sql_not_contains": ["status = 'paid'"]}, "tag": "no-borrowed-filters", "note": "order_count/customer_count carry no status filter. Applying revenue's would be a filter the contract never stated."}
{"id": "sql-025", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu của khách tên O'Brien", "request": {"filters": [{"column": "customer_name", "op": "eq", "value": "O'Brien"}]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["t0.customer_name = 'O''Brien'"], "sql_not_contains": []}, "tag": "literal-escaping", "note": "Filter values are contract- or caller-supplied, never raw question text — but they are still escaped by type, not trusted."}
{"id": "sql-026", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu", "request": {"dimensions": ["department"]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "error": "UNRESOLVED_ENTITY"}, "tag": "hallucinated-dimension", "note": "'department' is not in the contract. Failing loudly beats emitting SQL against a column that does not exist."}
